body:
I used the Amazon desktop app to upload a 9.8 Gb file, and cancelled it after 4 hours 45 minutes, because it should have completed in less than half that time.  Then about 10 minutes later I ran a copy command with the beta on the Linux system and got this

> 2016/08/07 13:53:11 Attempt 1/3 failed with 0 errors and: HTTP code 429: "429 Too Many Requests", reponse body: {"logref":"ce687c99-5cc7-11e6-aa7b-f54206d79a82","message":"System unavailable. Please back off for a while and try again later"}

It did make the connection on automatic retry.  It is probably not a big deal but I thought I might as well report it.
